WEBVTT

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.970
I had fun last night.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.010
When can I see you again?

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:25.850
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:30.150
Would you look me in the eyes?

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:35.020
How long are you going to wear that ring?

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:39.710
I get it. You still have feelings for her.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:46.700
You said all those nice things to me. It's not fair.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.210
You invited <i>me.</i>

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:54.790
Now hold on a second.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.660
We'll be awaiting your next visit.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.610
Buona notte.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:09.420
Buona notte.

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:23.400
<i>This mysterious restaurant is on a road just a little ways from the center of Rome.</i>

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:00.730
Paradiso

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:00.280
Well? Gotten used to the restaurant yet?

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:04.640
Absolutely. I mean, Vito, Luciano, and all of you have been so kind to me...

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.380
Furio! Teo!

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:10.550
Not often I see you with a young lady in tow. A new staff member?

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.910
This is Nicoletta. She's apprenticing with us.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.290
Nice to meet you.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.000
Likewise. And I appreciate your patronage.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.580
This is Mauro. He owns this stand.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:24.740
I always try to come here when we need vegetables, in between deliveries.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.800
He's always got some unique things for sale.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.810
I can see that.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.460
Have any puntarelle?

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.880
We been sold out for hours. What time do you think it is?

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.180
Sheesh, I was just asking.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.450
Hey, I told you not to do that!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:46.010
Say, do you have a girlfriend, Teo?

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:50.300
Depends who's asking, I suppose.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.620
What does that mean?

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.470
He's just shy.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.600
Must be nice...

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:14.700
That daughter of mine... Looks like she's got a crush on Claudio.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.870
Seriously?

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:22.110
The one with the red hair, right? I saw her at the restaurant.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:26.870
But I'm not surprised to hear she did, considering she's <i>your</i> daughter.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.910
Daughter?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:31.780
A good friend of mine's daughter.
I treat her like my own.

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.450
Really now?

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.730
Oh, I think I heard about her.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:37.820
Huh?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:42.520
I was talking to Claudio about his wedding ring and when he's gonna take it off.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.400
She may have gotten the wrong idea.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:48.400
There's nothing wrong about it, Gabrielle.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:52.140
Did he say he's still in love with me?

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.530
That's decidedly untrue, Olga.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:57.210
He may have had feelings for me when we broke up,

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:01.820
but now it's only because he missed his chance to lose the ring.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.530
Now he's stuck in a holding pattern.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.660
Olga, you've got a client.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.900
Your afternoon schedule is packed, so please hurry!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.360
Fine, fine.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.860
Anyway, let her be. It'll do her well.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:20.170
She still has lots to learn...

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.790
Another divorce case today?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.590
I'm so sick of them...

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.880
Why do relationships have to be so complicated?

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.290
Olga!

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:30.480
Be right there!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:34.110
It's tough to be a sought-after attorney.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.550
Season the vegetables.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:40.360
But don't put so much in as to taint the color of the ravioli.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:44.240
We're going to serve this as the staff meal, but do you want to try it?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.380
She seems a bit down today, huh?

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:01.320
Claudio.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.580
She's depressed.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:11.820
Uh, wait, Luciano?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.340
It's because Gabrielle came by, I bet.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:19.190
Even if she's your <i>ex-</i>wife.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:24.030
I know it bothers her. Everyone knows she started working here because she has a thing for you.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.960
It's all fine and dandy if you want to date a young girl like Vito,

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:33.210
but if you don't, stop being so kind to her.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.880
Don't get her hopes up.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.440
Tonight was another splendid dinner.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.380
Here's a little token of my gratitude.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.010
Thank you very much.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.560
I can't make it next week, unfortunately.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.880
I finally got tickets to the opera in Milan, so I'll be going there.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:55.320
Oh, Santa Lucia!

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.990
Table five is ready for their primo course.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:04.130
Sure thing.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:11.120
<i>Maybe it's my imagination, but he's been avoiding looking at me since that night.</i>

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.090
Nicoletta, stop daydreaming.

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:15.060
Oh, right.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.810
Night, guys.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.340
It's my treat. Let's have a glass of wine at the enoteca.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.240
Sorry, I have something to get to.

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:35.940
Sorry to hear that.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:39.190
I'll take a rain check.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:45.000
<i>Is he avoiding me after all?</i>

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:51.570
That's quite the bargain, Gigi.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:53.650
What do you say, a hundred Euro?

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.380
You're breaking my balls, man.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:00.760
Guess it's a deal.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.430
I've been looking for this one.

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:07.800
What? Your wife is really that young, Vito?!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:10.430
Yes, she's still in college.

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:11.610
Really?

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:14.260
I met her at my old gym.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.920
I was the one who approached her.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.920
A couple of exercise-freaks, those two.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:23.150
Be careful when you're with him,
unless you like muscle pain.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.140
So, what's it like being married to someone so much younger than you?

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:28.600
I don't really think about it.

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.900
Every day is a lot of fun, to be honest.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.820
You don't say.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:40.530
Say, Vito... Claudio's ex-

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:42.030
Buonasera.

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.880
Angela, you're late.

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.300
Who's that?

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:48.800
Furio's wife.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:51.060
That's her.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.040
You're Nicoletta, right?

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.150
My husband told me about you.

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:01.950
I'm Angela. Pleasure to meet you.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.300
O-Oh, likewise.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.670
So, how's the wine?

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:10.280
Good.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:16.490
Yes, I think I'll have the same.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.730
You got it.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:24.020
This is my lovely bride.

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:26.580
I see...

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.880
Everyone looks so happy.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.870
Good night. I'll call you.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.040
Oh, hi.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:08.000
Ouch. Long day at work?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.900
Yeah, exactly.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.120
I had dinner with a couple who are a client of mine.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.130
My shoulders are all stiff now.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.210
Say, want to have a glass of wine over there?

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.070
Maybe next time.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.680
I'll swing by the restaurant sometime then.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:24.730
Ciao.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:39.210
You're late.

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:42.180
Where the heck were you off gallivanting?

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.340
Delinquent girl.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:10.430
What's with all these clothes?

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.430
They're all yours.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.710
You <i>just</i> bought me some clothes.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.970
I was out shopping and couldn't resist.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.600
What about work?

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:21.850
My afternoon was free, what can I say?

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:24.070
OK, I'll go put some tea on.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.790
You met Gabrielle, right?

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:47.810
H-Huh?

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.170
She's a close friend of mine.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:57.510
I told you to lay off Claudio, right? About that...

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:03.300
I won't say anything if you're serious about him.

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:11.320
Thank you.

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.000
You're welcome.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.670
So? Are you?

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:32.540
I can't tell if my feelings are real or not.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:37.480
But I do think... Yeah, he's special.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:42.820
I'm happy when he's around,

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.420
and I can't take my eyes off of him.

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.170
That's love.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:52.750
Your mind is filled with thoughts of him. I get it.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.710
That's the most exciting time.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.120
You've got the real thing, so be confident about it.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.350
But, I...

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:08.790
As your mother, I should be telling you to date someone your own age.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:12.860
However, as a fellow woman, I want to say that love knows no age.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:18.130
But Claudio's a tough one, so I don't think it'll be easy for you.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:26.490
The other night, I thought that maybe he still has feelings for her.

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:29.830
Yeah, that might be true.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:34.950
But he just wears that ring to keep the customers at bay.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:39.460
Hey, what was it like when you fell in love with the owner?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.040
Love at first sight.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:43.290
What?

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.380
Did he used to be really slender and intelligent-looking?

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:51.210
Nope. He hasn't changed a bit.

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:56.550
He looked like a bear. I fell in love the first time I laid eyes on him.

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:01.470
Was he wearing glasses?

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:03.150
He's got 20/20 vision.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.990
Don't you have a spectacles-fetish?

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.810
Big time.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:14.130
So when he was opening the restaurant,

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:18.300
I made him promise to have all the employees wear spectacles.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:20.930
Isn't he such a sweetheart?

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:29.510
I screwed up once, so I vowed not to fall in love,
and tried to focus exclusively on work.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.610
But once I fall for someone, I'm hopeless.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.390
I fall head over heels.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.370
He proposed to me, though.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:44.070
But he was dead set on not marrying a woman with a child.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:48.050
That's why I had to keep you a secret.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.220
Sorry about that.

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:52.030
He scared me the other day, though.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:57.470
He's got a pretty keen sense of intuition.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.480
<i>Looking at her...</i>

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:09.440
<i>I'm envious, and I feel kinda depressed.</i>

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:20.340
Let's see... Porro and broccoli...

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:26.730
You opened another expensive bottle of wine, Gigi.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.760
Every day. Because the owner doesn't notice.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.620
Hey, I'm not gonna complain about being able to drink good wine.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.890
You said it.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:36.280
Indeed.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:39.260
Good food calls for good wine.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.780
Dinner's ready.

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.400
A-Ah?

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.290
I'll help you.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:20.590
Just let me know if anything's bothering you.

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:25.090
I know this might seem strange of me of to say.

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:32.450
Umm, you've been acting a little odd ever since Gabrielle stopped by.

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:36.990
Y-Yeah, but that's not what I was thinking about right now.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:38.060
Hmm?

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:42.990
Claudio, you don't have to go out of your way to be nice to me.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:46.290
I overstepped my boundaries.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.480
Luciano said the same thing.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.330
That I'm bothering you, huh?

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:58.820
No, just that it's rude to be kind to you if it's not genuine.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.560
So what were you thinking about?

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:10.540
That I'm jealous of the owner's wife.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:12.270
As a fellow woman, that is.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:16.340
She's got both her work-life and love-life under control.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:19.300
Everyone here likes her too.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:25.380
I think you've got a lot in common with her, though...

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:31.110
You're both straightforward and empowered. But also...

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.970
She's my mother.

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:39.860
I said it.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:41.210
What?!

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.520
Keep that a secret.

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:48.080
The owner doesn't know either.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:51.350
I actually planned on telling him when I came here, though.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:55.420
She dumped me at my grandmother's when I was a little girl.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.430
She never cared for me much.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:03.960
And it was all so she could marry the owner.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:11.910
But, it's also because she got busy with work.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:17.910
I get the fact that her work kept her from caring for me until now.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:25.430
On the other hand, it pisses me off. Forcing me into this situation.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:30.040
I feel both jealous of her full lifestyle

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.940
and even more pissed off.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:36.660
My ex-wife works in the same office as her.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.710
Really?

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:46.610
She got busy with work as well and we were fighting.

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.740
And that's why you split up?

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:52.590
We tried to talk about it and ended up divorced.

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.880
We've got a lot in common, us two.

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:01.590
In that we were both cast aside?

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:07.560
I understand how you feel.

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:14.380
Back when we were still together, I could tell from the look on her face how full her life was.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:19.130
Seeing her like that made me feel a little uneasy.

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:25.040
If you ever have any questions, just let me know.

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:28.000
I'm not sure how much I can bring to the conversation,

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.170
but if you ever need someone to vent to...

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:33.640
You're such a nice guy, Claudio.

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:35.800
Are you like this to everyone?

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.910
In the spirit of full disclosure...

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:44.100
My real name is...

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:50.710
Santo Claudio Paradiso.

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.200
Paradiso?

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:25.090
Santo Claudio Paradiso...

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:30.490
Yes. I was often made fun of it as a child.

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:35.870
No, it means "heaven"! What better name could you ask for?

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:40.810
You can talk to me whenever you want.

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:43.990
Thank you.

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:58.350
He really does seem like a saint.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:15.900
casetta dell'orso

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:04.580
You work too much.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:11.270
After you're discharged tomorrow, want to stop for a drink on the way home?

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.920
You know, the one he works at.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:15.930
Sure.

00:22:54.910 --> 00:22:57.890
You know, let's watch this together next time.
